---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = '加入我們';
---
<Layout title={title}>
  <h1>{title}</h1>
  
  <section style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <h2>社群連結</h2>
    <p>歡迎透過以下平台追蹤我們的最新動態：</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/g/fMUcDSswKQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button line">LINE 交流群組</a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nycucomedy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button ig">Instagram (@nycucomedy)</a>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/people/%E9%99%BD%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%A4%E5%A4%A7%E8%B2%A2%E4%B8%B8%E5%96%9C%E5%8A%87%E7%A4%BE-NYCU-Comedy-Club/61563966988944/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button fb">Facebook 粉絲專頁</a>
      <a href="https://clubportal.nycu.edu.tw/club/view/info/9B845C6A-FABE-4A8F-BC79-2E544BDF9A59/outside" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button portal">陽明交大社團系統入口</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h2>電子報訂閱</h2>
    <p>如果你想收到我們的最新資訊 (Gmail)，歡迎訂閱我們：</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <!-- Substack Embed Code -->
      <iframe src="https://seanhhl.substack.com/embed?transparent=1&light=1" width="480" height="150" style="border: 0; background: transparent" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .button-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 350px;
  }
  .social-button {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }
  .social-button:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .social-button:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
  
  /* Brand Colors */
  .line { background-color: #06C755; }
  .ig { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433 0%, #e6683c 25%, #dc2743 50%, #cc2366 75%, #bc1888 100%); }
  .fb { background-color: #1877F2; }
  .portal { background-color: #4a5568; }
</style>

